B.atm=new A.c2("weapon_reaction_Spin","Spin","[Reaction] after making a melee attack or during an allies turn, spend your reaction and make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting enemies within 1. On success deal your weapons damage. If your weapon has reach, target enemies within 2 instead.",B.al,B.ed)
B.atq=new A.c2("weapon_reaction_Thrown","Thrown","[Reaction] During your turn, make a Ranged Attack vs Dex targeting an enemy range 3. On Problems your weapon lands in a space adjacent to the target. On success, the weapon is impaled. While impaled, the target moves at half speed. As an [Action] or a [Reaction] during your turn, make a Melee attack vs Str targeting an impaled enemy range 1. On Success, the target takes weapon damage, gains {Source} d6 bleed and then is knocked prone.  On problems, gain the weapon and the target gains {Source} d6 bleed. The target may spend an Action or reaction to pull out the weapon, Make a Status check vs Vit. On success, they gain {Source} d6 bleed and remove the weapon. On problems they gain {Half Source} d6 bleed and remove the weapon. If your weapon is impaled in a dead character your size or less, when range 1 during your turn, spend an [Action] or [reaction], make a Ranged Attack vs Dex targeting an enemy range 3. On success, gain your weapon and fling the body at the enemy dealing {Source d12} damage. On problems, the body lands adjacent to the target and the target has +1 to attacks against you.",B.al,B.ed)
