B.HJ=new A.fi("quadrupedal_herding","Herding","You may not climb. Gain +1 Speed. \nTrampling[Reaction] During your turn, Spend your reaction you may move through an enemy who is a smaller size than you, Make an Status Check vs Str, On Success, Deal {Difference in size between the target and you d6}.\nHerd: [Reaction] During a target ally\u2019s turn, Spend your reaction and move up to the target\u2019s speed as long as you end within 6 spaces of the target.")
