B.HH=new A.fi("quadrupedal_springing","Springing","Ignore difficult terrain, You may not climb. [Reaction] start of any turn, spend your reaction and dash {Half Level} spaces. You may target another creature, if you do make a status check vs Str, on success, knock them prone then dash {Half Level} space to a free space. Otherwise dash to a free space adjacent to the target. Allies may make a Dex defense to resist falling prone.")
