B.ajo=new A.bn("Terrifying","When you Succeed on an attack, or succeed a check to harm or destroy things, cause nearby civilians to flee in terror.",B.L,!1)
B.aiS=new A.bn("Lurking","If you haven't been seen in your form, you have advantage on conceal checks. Otherwise you gain +1 to conceal.",B.L,!1)
B.aiQ=new A.bn("Alluring","You have a +1 to convince results.",B.L,!1)
