B.Sm=new A.m("feature_mushrooms_Skippers","Skippers","For Enemies, On success Reduce their speed by {Half Source}. For Allies, On Success, Give them {Half Source} additional speed until the start of your turn. You may move your Mushrooms up to {Half Source} Spaces during each of your turns.")
