B.a1W=new A.cf("implement_Tome","Tome","Gain +1 to Results of Concentration Checks caused by damage.\n[Reaction] After you fail a concentration check, you may spend your reaction to reroll the check.",B.cx)
B.a1R=new A.cf("implement_Staff","Staff","When you use an action, If there aren't any enemies adjacent to you, you may target the ability as if you were standing in a free space within 2 of you.",B.cx)
B.a24=new A.cf("implement_Keyboard_Pants","Keyboard Pants","Range +1/+2 [Action], your next {Level /2} attacks using your [Action] gains the Proxy effect as if you had spent a reaction. Proxy [Reaction] When you make an Attack and there are no enemies adjacent to you, you may spend your reaction to target the ability from the location of an ally.",B.cx)
B.a2b=new A.cf("implement_Charging_Cable","Charging Cable","Before or After your [Action], Target an Ally within 3 and either you or the ally may reduce their shield to give it to the other. [Reaction] During an allies turn who is within 3, you may spend your reaction either you or the ally may reduce their shield to give it to the other.",B.cx)
B.a2a=new A.cf("implement_Rod","Rod","When you attack a target that you succeeded in attacking with a rod last round, gain a +1 to attack results and deal {Level /4 d6} bonus damage.",B.cx)
B.a25=new A.cf("implement_Totem","Totem","Before or After your [Action], place your totem in your space or a space within 1. Until you next turn, your allies in your totem location gain +1 to Defense results.",B.cx)
B.a29=new A.cf("implement_Blood","Blood","After you succeed on a Melee Attack, gain {Level /3} blood. When you use an [Action] to make a Melee Attack, you may spend 1 blood to target 1 enemy in the situation instead.",B.cx)
B.a1Z=new A.cf("implement_Cards","Cards","Once a Round, When you fail a check, you may draw from a standard 52 card deck. On a black card you succeed instead, on a Red you fail, On Joker, fall prone. Shuffle the deck at the start of each situation.",B.cx)
B.a20=new A.cf("implement_Tarot","Tarot Cards","Once a Round, When an ally fail a check, Draw a Tarot card, If its a Wand or Sword, they succeed. If its a Major arcana, they succeed and gain {Half Level d6} shield. Shuffle the deck at the start of each situation.",B.cx)
B.a2f=new A.cf("implement_Horn","Horn, Instrument","Horning [Reaction]: When an enemy within 6 makes an Attack, You may spend your reaction to give you and all allies targeted by the attack gain a +1 to defense results.\nInstrument: gain +2 range when targeting only your allies.",B.ce)
B.a2_=new A.cf("implement_chant","Chant, Instrument","Chant [Reaction] When you fail a concentration check to maintain a feature that targets an ally, you or any ally you can see may spend their reaction to allow you to reroll the check with a +1 bonus to the result. Your team may pay to reroll any number of times.\nInstrument: gain +2 range when targeting only your allies.",B.ce)
B.a2c=new A.cf("implement_Bass","Bass, Instrument","Jammin': When you use a feature targeting enemies that have been hit by one of your allies' attacks this round, gain a +1 bonus to results of attacks against the targets.\nInstrument: gain +2 range when targeting only your allies.",B.cx)
B.a1T=new A.cf("implement_Guitar","Guitar, Instrument","Solo: end of round, any enemy you attacked who wasn't attacked by one of your allies takes {Power} damage.\nInstrument: gain +2 range when targeting only your allies.",B.cx)
B.a2e=new A.cf("implement_Drums","Drums, Instrument","Before or After your [Action], Target an Ally within 6 and force them to dash 1 space.\nInstrument: gain +2 range when targeting only your allies.",B.cx)
